window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-a2f2cdfa15454173"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"synthesize-research-evidence\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">汇总研究证据</h1> <p>构建可追溯来源的研究证据基础。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT，综合论文、研究笔记、方法文件、以往提案、资助方指导和研究或资助目标，梳理研究现状、主题、分歧、局限和待核实的主张。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>正在准备文献综述或资助项目构想的教师或研究人员。</li> <li>分散在论文、笔记和既往提案中的证据材料。</li> <li>需要可追溯来源和明确局限说明的草稿主张。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>google-drive</code></td> <td>收集已批准的论文资料集、笔记、方法文件和提案材料。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>生成结构化的证据简报，其中包含来源链接和待核实的主张标记。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>建立文献或资助项目证据基础</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>high</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">请综合我提供的论文、研究笔记、方法文件、既往提案、资助方指导、资助目标和引用要求。\n\n请按以下维度整理证据：\n- 主题\n- 分歧\n- 方法局限\n- 与各项研究目标或资助目标的相关性\n- 尚待回答的问题\n\n请制作一份研究现状梳理或资助项目证据简报，附上来源链接，并标出需要教师核实的主张。不要编造引用，也不要夸大证据。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"define-the-evidence-corpus\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">明确证据资料集</h2> <p>收集已批准的论文、笔记、方法文件、既往提案摘录、资助方指导、目标草案和引用要求。记录哪些来源具有权威性，哪些仅作背景参考。</p> <p>请 ChatGPT 先盘点资料集。尽早处理缺失文件、重复项和无法访问的参考资料。</p> <p><a id=\"build-a-traceable-evidence-brief\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">制作可追溯的证据简报</h2> <p>起始提示词应要求生成以下内容：</p> <ol> <li>主题和相互一致之处。</li> <li>有实际意义的分歧。</li> <li>方法和证据局限。</li> <li>与各项研究或资助目标对应的证据。</li> <li>尚待回答的问题和缺失的支持材料。</li> <li>每项实质性主张的来源链接。</li> </ol> <p>将来源中的发现与解释、提案措辞分开。</p> <p><a id=\"review-claims-and-citations\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_8\">审核主张和引用</h2> <p>对照原始来源核验每项引用。检查引述或转述是否保留了原文的适用范围、研究群体、方法和不确定性。</p> <p>可以使用后续提示词，强化支持不足的部分、比较相互竞争的证据，或建立“主张—来源”对照表。解释研究结果、确保引用准确以及确定提案中的最终主张，仍由教师或研究人员负责。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"synthesize-research-evidence\">Synthesize research evidence</h1> <p>Build a source-linked evidence base for research or proposals.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT to synthesize papers, research notes, methods documents, prior proposals, funding guidance, and grant aims into a research landscape with themes, disagreements, limitations, and claim-review flags.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Faculty preparing a literature review or grant concept.</li> <li>Evidence collections spread across papers, notes, and prior proposals.</li> <li>Draft claims that need traceable sources and explicit limitations.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>google-drive</code></td> <td>Gather the approved paper corpus, notes, methods documents, and proposal materials.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>Produce a structured evidence brief with source links and claim-review flags.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Build a Literature or Grant Evidence Base</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>high</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Synthesize the papers, research notes, methods documents, prior proposals, funding guidance, grant aims, and citation requirements I provide.\n\nOrganize the evidence by:\n- theme\n- disagreement\n- methods limitation\n- relevance to each research or grant aim\n- open question\n\nCreate a research landscape or grant evidence brief with source links and claims that require faculty verification. Do not invent citations or overstate the evidence.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">Plugins</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"define-the-evidence-corpus\">Define the evidence corpus</h2> <p>Collect the approved papers, notes, methods documents, prior proposal excerpts, funder guidance, draft aims, and citation requirements. Record which sources are authoritative and which are background only.</p> <p>Ask ChatGPT to inventory the corpus before synthesizing it. Resolve missing files, duplicates, and inaccessible references early.</p> <h2 id=\"build-a-traceable-evidence-brief\">Build a traceable evidence brief</h2> <p>The starter prompt should produce:</p> <ol> <li>Themes and areas of agreement.</li> <li>Meaningful disagreements.</li> <li>Methods and evidence limitations.</li> <li>Evidence mapped to each research or grant aim.</li> <li>Open questions and missing support.</li> <li>Source links for every substantive claim.</li> </ol> <p>Keep source findings separate from interpretation and proposal language.</p> <h2 id=\"review-claims-and-citations\">Review claims and citations</h2> <p>Verify each citation against the original source. Check that quoted or paraphrased findings preserve scope, population, method, and uncertainty.</p> <p>Use follow-up prompts to strengthen weakly supported sections, compare competing evidence, or create a claim-to-source matrix. Faculty remain responsible for interpretation, citation accuracy, and final proposal claims.</p>"};
